title: Zainab Kovac
from: Zainab Kovac
gist: Kovac heard about the transfer. She wouldn't tell you what to do. She said she'd knit faster.
== lines
kovac-zainab: Oh. Hi. I heard. About headquarters. Sorry. Everyone's heard.   [sigh]
kovac-zainab > you: I'm not going to say. What you should do. It's not mine to say.
kovac-zainab: I wrote two lists. Stay and go. They came out the same length. I checked twice.
? choice
* What was on them?   flavour:listen
